  "date": "30/04/1997",
  "content": "It's difficult to describe, it was difficult for me to find the right words. First thing was an unfathomable black and the feeling of an out of body experience. Then the light, everywhere, not dazzling, neither hot nor cold, like being bathed in love. I saw my all life story, but when they send me back to earth (or maybe I decided on my own to come back) they erased all that I saw (probably to not modify my destiny in any way?). Anyway, after my come back (additionally very difficult) I kept some memories in mind about my trip in the other side. There is also the concept of time. Time doesn't exist either. The absence of fear - all the time, I was fearless; from that time I knew I would die and up to now. And there was also the 'music'.\n\nIt's difficult to describe, it was difficult for me to find the right words.\n\nFirst thing was an unfathomable black and the feeling of an out of body experience. Then the light, everywhere, not dazzling, neither hot nor cold, like being bathed in love.\n\nI saw my all life story, but when they send me back to earth (or maybe I decided on my own to come back) they erased all that I saw (probably to not modify my destiny in any way?).\n\nAnyway, after my come back (additionally very difficult) I kept some memories in mind about my trip in the other side.\n\nThere is also the concept of time. Time doesn't exist either. The absence of fear - all the time, I was fearless; from that time I knew I would die and up to now. And there was also the 'music'.",
